<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="gu">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>SNA સ્પર્શ - પૂર્વ તૈયારી બિલ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Gujarati:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1e3a8a;
            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            --accent: #0284c7;
            --secondary: #0d9488;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --danger-soft: #fef2f2;
            --success: #16a34a;
            --gray-100: #f1f5f9;
            --gray-200: #e2e8f0;
            --gray-300: #cbd5e1;
            --gray-700: #334155;
            --gray-800: #1e293b;
            --radius-lg: 12px;
            --radius-md: 8px;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans Gujarati', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--gray-800);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 12px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1040px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Top Hero Header */
        .app-hero {
            background: var(--primary-gradient);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .hero-title h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: #dbeafe;
        }

        /* Cards */
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .card-header-styled {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .card-header-styled h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 15.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        /* School Info Grid */
        .school-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gray-700);
        }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 9px 12px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-300);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            outline: none;
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--gray-800);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #2563eb;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);
        }

        /* Head allocation row design - Fully Responsive Flex/Grid */
        .head-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .head-input-wrap {
            flex: 1 1 280px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .head-amount-wrap {
            flex: 1 1 120px;
            min-width: 100px;
        }

        .head-action-wrap {
            flex: 0 0 38px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 9px 15px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .btn-outline-primary {
            background: #eff6ff;
            color: #2563eb;
            border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
        }

        .btn-outline-danger {
            background: var(--danger-soft);
            color: var(--danger);
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .btn-clear {
            background: var(--gray-100);
            color: var(--gray-700);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
        }

        .btn-view-60 {
            background: #059669;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 9px 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.2);
            flex: 1 1 auto;
        }

        .btn-view-60:hover {
            background: #047857;
        }

        .btn-view-40 {
            background: #0284c7;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 9px 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
            flex: 1 1 auto;
        }

        .btn-view-40:hover {
            background: #0369a1;
        }

        .btn-view-combo {
            background: #7c3aed;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25);
            flex: 1 1 100%;
        }

        /* Screen Preview Table */
        .table-responsive {
            overflow-x: auto;
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        }

        table.preview-table {
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 650px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        table.preview-table th {
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: var(--gray-700);
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 9px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--gray-200);
            text-align: left;
        }

        table.preview-table td {
            padding: 8px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .head-list-screen {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .head-tag-screen {
            font-size: 11px;
            background: #f0fdf4;
            color: #166534;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .summary-banner {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 12px 14px;
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .grand-highlight {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* ==================== MODAL (PREVIEW POPUP) STYLING ==================== */
        .modal-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
            z-index: 1000;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 10px 6px;
        }

        .modal-container {
            background: #ffffff;
            max-width: 880px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
        }

        .modal-top-bar {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .modal-title {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .modal-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-modal-print {
            background: #10b981;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-modal-print:hover {
            background: #059669;
        }

        .btn-close-modal {
            background: #ef4444;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .btn-close-modal:hover {
            background: #dc2626;
        }

        .modal-content-area {
            padding: 12px;
            background: #ffffff;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        /* ==================== A4 SINGLE PAGE & A5 SPLIT LAYOUT ==================== */
        .printable-sheet {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.35;
            min-width: 580px;
        }

        .sheet-section-half {
            padding: 4px 0;
        }

        .cut-divider {
            border-top: 1.5px dashed #475569;
            margin: 10px 0;
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cut-label {
            position: absolute;
            top: -9px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 0 8px;
            font-size: 9.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #64748b;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .sheet-header-card {
            border: 1.2px solid #000;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 5px 8px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .sheet-header-card h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14.5px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #000;
        }

        .sheet-header-meta {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #222;
            margin: 2px 0 3px;
        }

        .sheet-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1.5px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 14px;
        }

        .voucher-meta-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .sheet-section-title {
            font-size: 10.5px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #000;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            border-left: 3.5px solid #000;
            margin: 5px 0 4px;
        }

        .sheet-edp-box {
            border: 1.2px solid #000;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .sheet-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .sheet-table th, .sheet-table td {
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            padding: 3px 5px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .sheet-table th {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #000;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Aligned Table for Section 3 */
        .sub-align-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .sub-align-table tr td {
            border: none !important;
            padding: 1px 2px !important;
            vertical-align: baseline;
        }

        .sub-align-table tr:not(:last-child) {
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #cbd5e1 !important;
        }

        .sub-head-name {
            font-size: 9.5px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .sub-head-amt {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #000;
            white-space: nowrap;
            width: 85px;
        }

        /* Mobile specific adjustments */
        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 8px 6px;
            }
            .card {
                padding: 12px;
            }
            .hero-title h1 {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .head-row {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            .head-input-wrap, .head-amount-wrap {
                width: 100%;
                flex: none;
            }
            .head-action-wrap {
                justify-content: flex-end;
            }
            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .btn-view-combo, .btn-view-60, .btn-view-40 {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }

        /* Print Media Query */
        @media print {
            @page {
                size: A4 portrait;
                margin: 6mm 8mm;
            }

            body {
                background: #ffffff !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
                margin: 0 !important;
            }

            .no-print, .modal-top-bar {
                display: none !important;
            }

            .modal-overlay {
                display: block !important;
                position: static !important;
                background: transparent !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
            }

            .modal-container {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: none !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
                margin: 0 !important;
            }

            .modal-content-area {
                padding: 0 !important;
                overflow: visible !important;
            }

            .printable-sheet {
                font-size: 9.5px !important;
                line-height: 1.2 !important;
                min-width: auto !important;
            }

            .sheet-table th, .sheet-table td {
                padding: 2px 4px !important;
            }

            .sheet-section-title {
                margin: 4px 0 3px !important;
                padding: 2px 4px !important;
                font-size: 9.5px !important;
            }

            .sheet-edp-box {
                margin-bottom: 4px !important;
                padding: 3px 6px !important;
            }

            .sheet-header-card {
                padding: 3px 6px !important;
                margin-bottom: 4px !important;
            }

            .sheet-header-card h2 {
                font-size: 13px !important;
            }

            .cut-divider {
                margin: 6px 0 !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Hidden Datalist for Fast Autocomplete/Search -->
<datalist id="headsDatalist">
</datalist>

<div class="container no-print">

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="app-hero">
        <div class="hero-title">
            <span style="font-size: 24px;">📑</span>
            <h1>SNA સ્પર્શ - પૂર્વ તૈયારી બિલ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">મોબાઈલ & ડેસ્કટોપ અનુકૂળ ડિઝાઇન | સમગ્ર શિક્ષા (IA Portal) હેડ સ્માર્ટ સર્ચ</p>
    </div>

    <!-- School Information Card -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header-styled">
            <h2><span>🏫</span> શાળા તેમજ વાઉચરની વિગત</h2>
            <span style="font-size: 11.5px; color: #64748b;">(પ્રિન્ટ સ્લિપ માટે)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="school-grid">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="schoolName">શાળાનું નામ:</label>
                <input type="text" id="schoolName" class="form-control" placeholder="દા.ત. પ્રાથમિક શાળા...">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="udiseCode">UDISE કોડ:</label>
                <input type="text" id="udiseCode" class="form-control" placeholder="દા.ત. 241907...">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="voucherNo">વાઉચર સંદર્ભ / ફાઈલ નંબર:</label>
                <input type="text" id="voucherNo" class="form-control" placeholder="દા.ત. 15/2026-27">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="billDate">તારીખ:</label>
                <input type="date" id="billDate" class="form-control">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Beneficiary Entry Form -->
    <div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid #2563eb;">
        <div class="card-header-styled">
            <h2><span>➕</span> નવો લાભાર્થી ઉમેરો</h2>
            <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; background:#eff6ff; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">નવી એન્ટ્રી</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="beneficiaryName">લાભાર્થીનું નામ / પેઢીનું નામ: <span style="color:var(--danger)">*</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="beneficiaryName" class="form-control" placeholder="લાભાર્થી / દુકાનદારનું નામ દાખલ કરો..." style="font-size: 14px;">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dynamic Head Allocation Section -->
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px dashed #cbd5e1; padding: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom: 8px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px;">
                <label style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--primary);">
                    ગ્રાન્ટ હેડ સર્ચ અને રકમ ફાળવણી (૧૦૦% મૂળ રકમ):
                </label>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="addHeadRow()">
                    + હેડ ઉમેરો
                </button>
            </div>

            <div id="headsContainer">
                <!-- Head input rows dynamically generated here -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex:1 1 140px;" onclick="saveBeneficiary()">
                💾 લાભાર્થી સેવ કરો
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-clear" style="flex:1 1 120px;" onclick="resetForm()">
                ફોર્મ ખાલી કરો
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Beneficiary List Card -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header-styled">
            <h2><span>📋</span> ઉમેરેલા લાભાર્થીઓની યાદી</h2>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-clear" style="padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 11.5px;" onclick="clearAllData()">
                🗑️ બધો ડેટા સાફ કરો
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="preview-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 40px; text-align: center;">ક્રમ</th>
                        <th>લાભાર્થીનું નામ</th>
                        <th>હેડ વાઇઝ વિગત (૧૦૦%)</th>
                        <th style="text-align: right; width: 110px;">કુલ રકમ</th>
                        <th style="text-align: right; width: 100px; color:#059669;">૬૦% રકમ</th>
                        <th style="text-align: right; width: 100px; color:#0284c7;">૪૦% રકમ</th>
                        <th style="width: 45px; text-align: center;">ક્રિયા</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="beneficiaryTableBody">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="7" style="text-align: center; padding: 25px; color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic;">
                            હજુ સુધી કોઈ લાભાર્થી ઉમેરેલ નથી. કૃપા કરીને ઉપરના ફોર્મમાંથી લાભાર્થી ઉમેરો.
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Totals summary banner -->
        <div class="summary-banner" id="totalsBar" style="display: none;">
            <div>
                <strong>લાભાર્થીઓ:</strong> <span id="countBeneficiaries" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:700;">0</span> | 
                <strong>ગ્રાન્ટ હેડ:</strong> <span id="countHeads" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:700;">0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grand-highlight">
                કુલ રકમ: ₹<span id="grandTotal">0.00</span> 
                <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:#475569; margin-top:2px;">
